=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_9c4e — Journal at the Desk All Day, Nightstand Only in the Evening (fork of p_d4e7)

This fork of p_d4e7 extends the journal's desk window to cover the full waking day. The parent placed the journal at desk_b1 from 7:00 to 13:00 and at nightstand_b1 from 14:00 to 22:00. The patrol evidence now shows the journal at desk_b1 at 03:00 (twice) and at 12:00 (twice), but at nightstand_b1 by 18:00. The 9–17 h looks at desk_b1 found it 2 times and found nothing 0 times, confirming the desk is its daytime home. The 3 a.m. sightings (desk × 2 vs. nightstand × 1) mean Marco leaves the journal on the desk overnight rather than moving it to the nightstand until the evening. The transition to the nightstand happens between 12:00 and 18:00—most likely when Marco returns from work around 23:00 and sets it beside the bed, or Yuki moves it. I shift the desk block to 0–17 h and the nightstand block to 17–24 h. The lunchbox and vitamins OUT_OF_HOUSE blocks are retained from the parent.

What would refute this: the journal sighted at nightstand_b1 before 17:00 on a weekday, or at desk_b1 after 18:00.

